<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: These quirks influence the pawns capability of moving the bar in their favor during a vore grapple. These apply to both attacking and defending.-->
  <GrappleStrength.description>这些怪癖会影响 pawns 在以下环境中移动杆的能力:吃人格斗。这些适用于进攻和防守。</GrappleStrength.description>
  <!--EN: Grapple strength-->
  <GrappleStrength.label>格斗强度</GrappleStrength.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has issues when it comes to wrestling with [PAWN_possessive] opponents.-->
  <GrappleStrength_Bad.description>[PAWN_label]有问题，当涉及到与[PAWN_possessive]敌人。</GrappleStrength_Bad.description>
  <!--EN: Weak grip-->
  <GrappleStrength_Bad.label>弱抓</GrappleStrength_Bad.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has some experience when it comes to wrestling.-->
  <GrappleStrength_Good.description>[PAWN_label]在摔跤方面有些经验。</GrappleStrength_Good.description>
  <!--EN: Wrestler-->
  <GrappleStrength_Good.label>摔角手</GrappleStrength_Good.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has no special experience that affects grapple strength.-->
  <GrappleStrength_Normal.description>[PAWN_label]没有影响格斗强度的特殊经验。</GrappleStrength_Normal.description>
  <!--EN: Normal-->
  <GrappleStrength_Normal.label>普通</GrappleStrength_Normal.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has suffered some injuries to [PAWN_possessive] wrists, which makes [PAWN_objective] useless in grappling combat.-->
  <GrappleStrength_VeryBad.description>[PAWN_label]受伤了[PAWN_possessive]手腕，这使[PAWN_objective]在格斗中毫无用处。</GrappleStrength_VeryBad.description>
  <!--EN: Carpal tunnel syndrome-->
  <GrappleStrength_VeryBad.label>腕管综合症</GrappleStrength_VeryBad.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] is an expert at hand-to-hand combat when it comes to wrestling for vore.-->
  <GrappleStrength_VeryGood.description>[PAWN_label]是格斗方面的专家吃人</GrappleStrength_VeryGood.description>
  <!--EN: Professional Wrestler-->
  <GrappleStrength_VeryGood.label>职业摔角手</GrappleStrength_VeryGood.label>
</LanguageData>
